---
// About Us – yellow card with manifesto text + image of man on phone
---
<section class="relative w-[1280px] h-[860px] mx-auto bg-vecta-bg">
  <!-- Lime rounded card -->
  <div class="absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 top-[24px] w-[1231px] h-[812px] rounded-[10px] bg-vecta-lime"></div>

  <!-- Right photo card (Rectangle 10) -->
  <div class="absolute left-[705px] top-[24px] w-[551px] h-[812px] rounded-r-[10px] overflow-hidden">
    <img
      src="/sections/about-us/man-phone.png"
      alt="Persona observando proyecto VECTA 98"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover"
    />
  </div>

  <!-- Title -->
  <h2 class="absolute left-[74px] top-[245px] w-[639px] text-vecta-dark font-semibold text-[60px] leading-[0.959]"
      style="font-family: 'Albert Sans', sans-serif;">
    Aquí no vendemos sueños inmobiliarios.
  </h2>

  <!-- Vertical accent lines -->
  <div class="absolute left-[80px] top-[207px] w-[495px] h-px bg-vecta-dark"></div>
  <div class="absolute left-[74px] top-[673px] w-[495px] h-px bg-vecta-dark"></div>
  <div class="absolute left-[74px] top-[691px] w-[292px] h-px bg-vecta-dark"></div>

  <!-- Body -->
  <div class="absolute left-[74px] top-[392px] w-[475px] text-vecta-dark text-[32px] leading-[0.959] space-y-[1em]"
       style="font-family: 'Albert Sans', sans-serif;">
    <p>El mercado está lleno de promesas, renders perfectos. Discursos aspiracionales. Rentabilidades sin contexto.</p>
    <p>
      <span class="font-bold">VECTA 98</span> parte de una lógica distinta: No se construyó para emocionar,
      <span class="font-bold">sino para funcionar.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
